<!-- ─────────────────────────────────── §5 Projections -->
<section id="s-proj" data-code="projections">
<div class="section-no">05 — Projections</div>
<h2>Bridging two hidden dimensions</h2>
<p>
  The backbone runs at <code>d_model = 1536</code>; the assistant runs at a smaller <code>hidden_size</code> (e.g. 768). Two projection layers bridge the gap.
</p>

<div class="vp">
  <div class="vp-head">
    <span class="vp-title">projection-pipeline.svg</span>
  </div>
